  &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191537/rss" title="interop-rank.fxdx.dev" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;The 2027 Web Platform Feature Ranking Returns&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — Back for a second year, Firefox's ranker lets you sign in with GitHub, compare and rank the Interop 2027 proposals. &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191538/rss" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;Jake Archibald says&lt;/a&gt; last year’s findings (taken from ~1,900 rankings) helped “&lt;em&gt;prioritise a lot of work this year”&lt;/em&gt;, so it's worth having your say.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;Firefox &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=" font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 15px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 1.2em;"&gt;⚡️&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="text-transform: uppercase;    font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.2em;"&gt;IN BRIEF&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📊 The &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191539/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;results of the 2026 &lt;em&gt;Stack Overflow&lt;/em&gt; Developer Survey&lt;/a&gt; are out. With over 30,000 responses, JavaScript came in as #1 language for the 12th year in a row.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🦊 Mozilla now &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191540/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;offers an &lt;em&gt;Enterprise&lt;/em&gt; version&lt;/a&gt; of Firefox, &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191541/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;focusing on things&lt;/a&gt; like compliance, regulatory requirements, security, and telemetry controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔒 Starting February next year &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191542/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;all new/renewed Let's Encrypt certificates will use a 64 day lifetime&lt;/a&gt; by default (down from 90).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧭 Apple has &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191543/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;shared a new page making their case&lt;/a&gt; for switching over from Chrome to Safari.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛡️ If you miss Arc, &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191544/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Crest is a new browser hoping to scratch a similar itch&lt;/a&gt;. It curiously offers both Chromium and WebKit rendering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
